SolarisPKN-Paste in Debian
==========================

This binary package provides only the Linux Python command-line copier.
It does not install the Windows GUI, Explorer extensions, shell integration,
privileged daemons, drivers, or services.

By default writes are staged and verified. It is an experimental preview;
do not rely on it as the sole backup of important data. Consult the
package README for coverage and known limitations.
